and see how databases can help you create reliable programs.

29
00:01:54,069 --> 00:01:58,630
and how databases can help you make your programs more observable and debugable.

30
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:02,550
So during the research project, we built several prototypes.

31
00:02:02,550 --> 00:02:04,709
and we wrote several papers and when we presented it,

32
00:02:04,709 --> 00:02:09,510
people are really excited about the capability that deboss can bring.

33
