00:37:22,790 --> 00:37:25,990
That was one big use case on your website.

532
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:36,069
Why is the problem surfacing now with AI agents and requiring durable executions specifically for that?

533
00:37:36,069 --> 00:37:40,790
So I think this is a really new and emerging use case for deboss.

534
00:37:40,790 --> 00:37:45,670
