00:37:55,750 --> 00:38:00,390
So say instead of developers coding what functions to call the function calling.

538
00:38:00,390 --> 00:38:06,390
or tool calling will be decided based on the LLM responses.

539
00:38:06,390 --> 00:38:11,589
So I actually I built a very interesting refund agent uh using langraph and deboss.

540
00:38:11,589 --> 00:38:16,550
So basically what an agent does is that when they receive a refund request,

541
00:38:16,550 --> 00:38:19,910
it will talk to LM to decide which tool to use.

