00:38:19,910 --> 00:38:25,190
Maybe based on the customer record, based on the order, it will call a refund workflow.

543
00:38:25,200 --> 00:38:27,750
So very simplistically, am I right in.

544
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:33,990
that the agent is essentially an LLM with tools at the most basic level?

545
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:37,110
Yeah. Okay. Sorry, continue.

546
00:38:37,119 --> 00:38:40,950
Yeah.

547
00:38:40,950 --> 00:38:43,910
So then like the agent can say basically oh.

548
00:38:43,910 --> 00:38:49,511
if the purchase was above a threshold I will need to send an email to an admin to. verify whether you.

549
00:38:49,511 --> 00:38:51,750
want to approve this refund.

550
00:38:51,750 --> 00:38:56,150
or not and then the refund workflow will have to wait for human input.

551
00:38:56,150 --> 00:38:58,870
and then decide what to do next.

552
00:38:58,870 --> 00:39:03,430
So I would say with AI agent the most challenging part is first dynamic execution of workflows.

