00:39:03,430 --> 00:39:07,910
you can no longer have a very static workflow like workflow branches.

554
00:39:07,910 --> 00:39:12,870
or function calling will be very dynamic based on the LLM output.

555
00:39:12,870 --> 00:39:19,430
and second it's really unreliable in many ways like from my point of view we treat AI as.

556
00:39:19,430 --> 00:39:25,589
a unreliable service in the stack so your AI call may fail.

557
00:39:25,589 --> 00:39:29,349
and then every time you call it it may give you a different result.

558
00:39:29,349 --> 00:39:33,829
and then third thing is that human in the loop is really tricky like how do we make.

559
00:39:33,829 --> 00:39:38,710
AI I work together with human is a kind of new. and challenging topic these days.

