00:41:17,839 --> 00:41:21,750
Yeah.

586
00:41:21,750 --> 00:41:25,109
So data pipeline is one like huge use case in deboss.

587
00:41:25,109 --> 00:41:32,390
where basically the typical pipeline sometimes goes the first is a workflow will first scrape websites.

588
00:41:32,390 --> 00:41:39,349
or scrape other data sources and store the PDFs or images into some S3 bucket.

589
00:41:39,349 --> 00:41:45,670
and then the second step will in parallel we'll use LMS to analyze those images or PDFs.

590
00:41:45,670 --> 00:41:50,950
and then the third step will be to persist the return value from LLMs into multiple data stores.

