00:46:49,270 --> 00:46:51,990
say this is the workflow this was the input.

664
00:46:52,000 --> 00:46:56,870
and those were the output of each step so we can instead of actually.

665
00:46:56,870 --> 00:46:58,710
so say if your workflow contains sending email.

666
00:46:58,710 --> 00:47:02,150
or calling out to stripe we will not actually call those external APIs will.

667
00:47:02,160 --> 00:47:04,950
instead return the recorded information.

668
00:47:04,960 --> 00:47:11,191
and then you'll be able to step through your workflow as if it happened in the past. So that's very cool.

